  "question": "Two fair dice are thrown. Let A be the event that the sum is a multiple of 3, and B be the event that both dice show the same number. Find:\n(a) $P(A)$, $P(B)$,\n(b) $P(A\\cap B)$,\n(c) Are the events A and B independent?",
